+---
+name: "Eyone Medical"
+description: "Suite e-santé interconnectée : SIH, dossier patient partagé et app Medical Passport. Grand prix Africa's Business Heroes 2024."
+category: "application"
+website: "https://eyone.net"
+city: "Dakar"
